WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.668
Cat followed Dirk to the Grim Dungeon.

2
00:00:24.669 --> 00:00:30.459
Water dripped from the ceiling.

3
00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:33.373
Dirk found the king locked up.

4
00:00:33.374 --> 00:00:39.712
"Your Majesty!" he cried.

5
00:00:39.713 --> 00:00:44.374
"I will free you!"

6
00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:47.771
Suddenly Daimon stepped out of the darkness.

7
00:00:47.772 --> 00:00:53.237
"I don't think so!"

8
00:00:53.238 --> 00:00:59.972
He pointed his wand at Dirk. Poof!

9
00:00:59.973 --> 00:01:05.701
Now Dirk was locked up too!

10
00:01:05.702 --> 00:01:08.749
Water dripped onto Daimon's hand.

11
00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:13.318
"Ack! I don't like water!" he cried.

12
00:01:13.319 --> 00:01:16.740
He quickly wiped it off.

13
00:01:16.741 --> 00:01:21.125
Cat licked her paw and watched.

14
00:01:21.126 --> 00:01:29.374
"Now I will take over the castle!" Daimon said.

15
00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:31.843
He rushed toward the Throne Room.

16
00:01:31.844 --> 00:01:35.062
Cat followed quietly.

17
00:01:35.063 --> 00:01:38.827
Everyone was gathered in the Throne Room.

18
00:01:38.828 --> 00:01:43.581
They were making plans to fight Daimon.

19
00:01:43.582 --> 00:01:47.188
Boom! The door flew open.

20
00:01:47.189 --> 00:01:51.776
It was Daimon!

21
00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:54.398
Ann pointed her wand at him.

22
00:01:54.399 --> 00:01:57.555
"We're going to stop you!" said Ann.

23
00:01:57.556 --> 00:02:00.380
"You'll never take over the castle."

24
00:02:00.381 --> 00:02:05.069
Daimon just laughed.

25
00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:08.624
"You think you're going to fight me.

26
00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:11.903
But you're all going to sleep!"

27
00:02:11.904 --> 00:02:14.239
Daimon flicked his wand.

28
00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:16.163
Cat leaped at Tom.

29
00:02:16.164 --> 00:02:21.781
Tom stumbled just as Daimon cast his spell.

30
00:02:21.782 --> 00:02:24.955
Ann fell asleep.

31
00:02:24.956 --> 00:02:28.117
So did the guards and the servants.

32
00:02:28.118 --> 00:02:31.933
But Tom lay on the floor, still awake.

33
00:02:31.934 --> 00:02:37.423
Daimon laughed with glee.

34
00:02:37.424 --> 00:02:40.302
"My sleeping spell worked.

35
00:02:40.303 --> 00:02:49.045
Now the castle is mine—all mine!"
